<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine SEC okays Omico capital hike.</title>
<headline>Philippine SEC okays Omico capital hike.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omico Corp said on Monday its plans to raise capital to one billion pesos from 100 million pesos was approved by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>Omico used to be a mining firm which converted to a holding firm and has now diversified interests, incuding building of hotels.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
